# Cloudflare Pages Redirects & API Proxy Configuration

# Proxy /api requests to your hosted FastAPI backend
# Replace "https://your-backend-server.onrender.com" with your actual backend URL once deployed
/api/*  https://your-backend-server.onrender.com/api/:splat  200

# Single Page Application (SPA) fallback routing for React
/*      /index.html                                          200
